---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import { site, categories } from '../config/site';
---

<Base title="About" description={`What ${site.name} is, who runs it, and how to contact the ${site.teamName}.`}>
  <div class="container section">
    <div class="prose">
      <h1>About {site.name}</h1>

      <p>
        {site.name} is a free website for students of {site.schoolName} (TIPS) and their parents. It brings together
        clear, friendly guides on four things:
      </p>
      <ul>
        {
          categories.map((c) => (
            <li>
              <a href={c.path}>{c.name}</a>: {c.blurb}
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>

      <h2>Who runs it</h2>
      <p>
        The site is written and looked after by the {site.teamName}. These are the counsellors who help TIPS students
        across all campuses with subject choices, careers, college applications and opportunities.
      </p>
      <p>
        Counsellors answer the same questions many times over. Writing the answers down once, in one trusted place,
        means every student gets the same quality of information, and parents can read it at home.
      </p>

      <h2>How to use it</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Use the search box to look for a career, a course, a test or a country.</li>
        <li>Not sure where to start? Go to <a href="/start/">Start here by grade</a>.</li>
        <li>Every post has a short <strong>For Parents</strong> box near the top.</li>
        <li>Tap <strong>Save</strong> on any post to keep it in <a href="/saved/">My Saved Posts</a> on this device.</li>
        <li>Check <a href="/deadlines/">Upcoming Deadlines</a> so you never miss an application date.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Contact the FP team</h2>
      <p>
        Have a question, spotted a mistake, or want a topic covered? Write to us at
        <a href={`mailto:${site.contactEmail}`}><Icon name="mail" size={18} /> {site.contactEmail}</a>, or talk to the
        FP counsellor at your campus.
      </p>

      <div class="note">
        <strong>Please note.</strong> Everything on this site is for guidance only. Fees, dates, cut-offs and rules
        change often. Always check the official link given in each post before you apply or pay for anything, and talk
        to your FP counsellor before making a big decision.
      </div>

      <h2>Your privacy</h2>
      <p>
        This site does not ask you to log in and does not collect any personal information. Saved posts stay in your
        own browser and are never sent anywhere.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
